main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ the exact pointer type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ a different parameter type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
